{
  "name": "伪装刺青 Masquerade Tattoo",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/tools/scribal/burnisher-tooth.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\">覆盖区域：一只手，一只脚或者一条肢体的四分之一</p><p class=\"wordsection1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">该魔法刺青用一根特殊的针制作，显现为你所想要的样子。</span> <br><em><strong>刺青同调。</strong></em> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">同调此物品时，你需要将针持握，并抵在你想要让刺</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">青出现</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">的那处皮肤上。当同调完成时，针头会化为墨水再变成刺青。若你与刺青的同调结束，刺青会消失，针头会再次出现在你的位置中。</span> <br><em><strong>液态油墨。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">作为一个附赠动作，你可以将刺青变为任意颜色或图纹，并移动到你皮肤上的任意区域。无论</span><span class=\"GramE\">其有着</span>什么形态，它看起来总是一个刺青。它的尺寸最小可为一枚铜币，大则可 <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">复盖</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">你的全身。</span> <br><em><strong>易容自我。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">作为一个动作，你可以使用刺青施展</span> <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.ju3LXSi72l6vso3l]{易容术 Disguise Self}</em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">法术（识破</span>DC13<span> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">）。使用刺青施展这道法术后，直到下次黎明前，不能再次用刺青施展。</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
